      "id": "2a329rj",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "1. Background of the Indian Constitution"
    },
    {
      "type": "keyFacts",
      "title": "Key Takeaways",
      "items": [
        "The Constituent Assembly was formulated under the Cabinet Mission Plan of 1946.",
        "Dr. Sachchidananda Sinha served as the interim President during the first meeting on December 9, 1946.",
        "Dr. Rajendra Prasad was elected as the permanent President of the Constituent Assembly on December 11, 1946.",
        "Dr. B.R. Ambedkar chaired the Drafting Committee, which was constituted on August 29, 1947.",
        "The Constitution was adopted on November 26, 1949, and fully enforced on January 26, 1950."
      ],
      "id": "4bm0q2i"
    },
