      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Dr. B.R. Ambedkar is designated as the 'Father of the Indian Constitution' and served as Chairman of the Drafting Committee.",
        "November 26 is celebrated across India as Constitution Day (Samvidhan Divas).",
        "January 26 was chosen as Republic Day to honor the 1930 Purna Swaraj declaration."
